-   ->  Merge Append
-         Sort Key: (COALESCE(prt1.a, p2.a)), (COALESCE(prt1.b, p2.b))
-         ->  Group
-               Group Key: (COALESCE(prt1.a, p2.a)), (COALESCE(prt1.b, p2.b))
