-                           ->  Seq Scan on prt1_p2 t1_2
-                                 Filter: (b = 0)
-               ->  Index Scan using iprt1_e_p2_ab2 on prt1_e_p2 t3_2
-                     Index Cond: (((a + b) / 2) = t2_2.b)
-         ->  Nested Loop
-               Join Filter: (t1_3.a = ((t3_3.a + t3_3.b) / 2))
