-                           Filter: ((b < 4) AND (a = ANY (ARRAY[$1, $2, $3])))
-                     ->  Parallel Seq Scan on ab_a1_b3 ab_3 (actual rows=N loops=N)
-                           Filter: ((b < 4) AND (a = ANY (ARRAY[$1, $2, $3])))
-(13 rows)
