-   InitPlan 1
-     ->  Result
-   ->  Seq Scan on p1 p
-         Filter: ((a = 1) AND (b = 1) AND (c = (InitPlan 1).col1))
-   ->  Seq Scan on q111 q1
-         Filter: ((a = 1) AND (b = 1) AND (c = (InitPlan 1).col1))
-   ->  Result
-         One-Time Filter: (1 = (InitPlan 1).col1)
-(9 rows)
