----------------------------------------------
- Bitmap Heap Scan on brin_hot_2
-   Recheck Cond: ((b = 100) AND (a = 2))
-   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on brin_hot_2_b_idx
-         Index Cond: (b = 100)
-(4 rows)
-
-SELECT COUNT(*) FROM brin_hot_2 WHERE a = 2 AND b = 100;
