---------------------------------
- Nested Loop Left Join
-   Join Filter: false
-   ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t1
-   ->  Result
-         One-Time Filter: false
-(5 rows)
-
--- Ensure the IS_NULL qual is not reduced to constant-FALSE when the column is
--- nullable by an outer join
