--------------------------------------------
- Nested Loop Left Join
-   Join Filter: (t2.a IS NULL)
-   ->  Nested Loop Left Join
-         Join Filter: (t1.a = 1)
-         ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t1
-         ->  Materialize
-               ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t2
-   ->  Materialize
-         ->  Seq Scan on pred_tab t3
-(9 rows)
